        "TileImage": "$($repository 63a9d3dc-ff4c-41e7-888a-6c794b8adffd).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is Paul Powers, famous tattoo artist, and currently our biggest threat. I know we aren&apos;t supposed to treat contracts personally, 47, but this time, I am the client. The motive of this assignment is that yesterday I got the most good-looking badass tattoo of a dragon and, if out target stays alive, he will most definitely make a cooler tattoo on Rico Delgado, and we just cannot allow this to happen. Intel suggests that our target is at the bar in Santa Fortuna.",
